  "content": "<h1>CoolAid的NoSignGUI</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loaders-Fabric/Forge/NeoForge-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Versions-1.20_|_1.21_|_26.1_|_26.2-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environments-Client-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>允许您关闭和开启告示牌文本界面！</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>当您使用大量空白告示牌进行建造或陷阱制作时，这尤其有用</strong></li>\n<li><strong>默认情况下，使用 <code>G</code> 键切换此模组开关</strong></li>\n<li><strong>灵感来源于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnosigngui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Masonion的NoSignGUI</a> 模组</strong></li>\n<li><strong>适用于悬挂告示牌，并完全在客户端运行</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>如有任何问题或功能请求，请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/CoolAid48/NoSignGUI/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交报告</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcoolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/J2SGshKNah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在Discord上与我聊天\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/coolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在Twitch上观看我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/twitch-singular_vector.svg\"></a></p>",
